# Truent probe scope allow-list.
#
# `truent probe <target> --authorized` refuses any target not listed here
# when this file (copied to `.truent-scope`, or passed with `--scope`) is
# present and non-empty. Loopback (127.0.0.1, ::1, localhost) is always
# allowed. One entry per line; `#` begins a comment.
#
# A domain matches itself and every subdomain:
# example.com
#
# A single host or a CIDR block:
# 203.0.113.7
# 10.0.0.0/24
# 2001:db8::/32
